===Etymology 1===
From {{inh|ang|gem-pro|*armaz}}, from {{etyl|ine-pro|ang}} {{m|ine-pro|*h₂erHmos||joint}}. Cognate with {{cog|ofs|arm}}, {{cog|osx|arm}}, {{cog|nl|arm}}, {{cog|goh|arm}} ({{cog|de|Arm}}), {{cog|non|armr}} ({{cog|sv|arm}}), {{cog|got|𐌰𐍂𐌼𐍃}}. The {{etyl|ine-pro|-}} root is also the source of {{cog|cu|рамо}} ({{cog|ru|рамо||shoulder}}), {{cog|la|armus}}.

